    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "As per prosecution case, it is alleged that after performing engagement, this petitioner made physical relation with the informant on many occasions and videographed the same in order to blackmail her and ultimately refused to marry her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1167,
      "end": 1405,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that no such occurrence, as alleged, ever took place.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1406,
      "end": 1503,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "As a matter of fact, Patna High Court CR. MISC. No.71357 of 2022(3) dt.19-06-2023 it was the informant herself who refused to marry with the petitioner and he is still ready to solemnize the marriage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1504,
      "end": 1704,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Patna High Court",
          "label": "COURT",
